#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/psutil.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests named <literal>TestSystemAPIs::test_disk_usage</literal>, "
"<literal>TestFetchAllProcesses::test_all</literal>, and "
"<literal>TestNetAPIs::test_net_if_addrs</literal> are known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Os testes nomeados de <literal>TestSystemAPIs::test_disk_usage</literal>, "
"<literal>TestFetchAllProcesses::test_all</literal> e "
"<literal>TestNetAPIs::test_net_if_addrs</literal> são conhecidos por "
"falharem."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/psutil.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test named <literal>TestSystemNetIfAddrs::test_ips</literal> is known to"
" fail if IPv6 tunelling is enabled in the kernel."
msgstr ""
"O teste nomeado de <literal>TestSystemNetIfAddrs::test_ips</literal> é "
"conhecido por falhar se tunelamento de IPv6 estiver habilitado no núcleo."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/psutil.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test named <literal>TestAvailProcessAPIs::test_io_counters</literal> is "
"known to fail if the kernel does not have "
"<option>CONFIG_TASK_IO_ACCOUNTING</option> enabled."
msgstr ""
"O teste nomeado de <literal>TestAvailProcessAPIs::test_io_counters</literal>"
" é conhecido por falhar se o núcleo não tiver "
"<option>CONFIG_TASK_IO_ACCOUNTING</option> habilitada."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/psutil.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test named <literal>TestExampleScripts::test_who</literal> is known to "
"fail if the login manager does not write into "
"<filename>/run/utmp</filename><phrase revision='systemd'> (note that due to "
"the potential year 2038 problem, if <xref linkend='shadow'/> is already "
"rebuilt in BLFS, it will stop writing into the file)</phrase>."
msgstr ""
"O teste nominado de <literal>TestExampleScripts::test_who</literal> é "
"conhecido por falhar se o gerenciador de login não escrever no "
"<filename>/run/utmp</filename><phrase revision='systemd'> (observe-se que, "
"devido ao potencial problema do ano 2038, se <xref linkend='shadow'/> já "
"estiver reconstruído no BLFS, ele parará de escrever no arquivo)</phrase>."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/psutil.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test named <literal>TestSystemAPIs::test_users</literal> is known to "
"fail if the <filename>/run/utmp</filename> file contains an entry for the "
"login screen.  It can also fail due to the same reason as "
"<literal>TestExampleScripts::test_who</literal>."
msgstr ""
"O teste nominado de <literal>TestSystemAPIs::test_users</literal> é "
"conhecido por falhar se o arquivo <filename>/run/utmp</filename> contiver "
"uma entrada para a tela de login. Ele também pode falhar devido ao mesmo "
"motivo que para o <literal>TestExampleScripts::test_who</literal>."

